        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-24T13:23:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry I did not mean to insult. I love what you have done with the game. I just got the impression from some of the posts that I have been seeing that iOS platform has been having problems with this release. I was assuming it was because of the size, but I know nothing about this stuff so I am really the least qualified to comment. I have sent in game feedback so hopefully you can find a fix. Honestly my wife is probably happy that I am operating without sound. She is tired of hearing the music from either the kids or myself all the time.&nbsp;</p>",
